# DUB-1 1.2.0's launch video, in one take: what's new, made for playing live. Every move on a bar's downbeat;
# the split framing (tools/film.py --layout split --scale 2). Night Drive (Full until bar 96: every move heard),
# then a transition by hand to Haze. The title clip covers the first 4 s (the boot's launch screen).
# Each `bar` prints the film's time there: the cue sheet (build/film/channel/long_videos/release-1.2.0/).
# Night Drive (5), from the boot's Basic (0), before the film: the first frame is the launch screen.
# (The 48 ms first: choosing the piece seeds its generators with the time, and this seed keeps Night Drive Full
# every phrase to the piece change, checked on the screen's section name bar by bar, so no Thin or Break phrase
# hides a move; the 1.2.0 build's swing and wider actions had turned bars 32-39 and 48-55 Thin.)
wait 48
turn PRESET 5 5
wait 30
expect piece 5
splash 0
wav 30-release-120.wav
film 30-release-120.film
bar 0 OPEN: the launch screen (under the title); Night Drive starts
splashrun
expect view 0
expect screen 0
bar 2 1. MADE FOR PLAYING LIVE: Night Drive, the Dub page
# ------------------------------------------------------------------ the Filter, HOME's first knob ---
bar 5 2. THE FILTER (KNOB 1): down, under water (Shut 90 over 3 bars)
turn K1 -45 125
bar 8 under water; the kick still pumping
bar 9 back up through Off
turn K1 45 60
bar 11 up: thin and bright (Open 80 over 2.5 bars)
turn K1 40 120
bar 14 back to Off
turn K1 -40 60
# ------------------------------------------------------------------ ALGORITHM: the screen ---
bar 16 3. ALGORITHM: the scope
turn ALGO 1 300
expect screen 1
bar 18 ALGORITHM: the spectrum
turn ALGO 1 300
expect screen 2
bar 20 ALGORITHM: the ripples again
turn ALGO 1 300
expect screen 0
# ------------------------------------------------------------------ HOME again: the Key page ---
bar 21 4. HOME again: the Key page
tap HOME
expect view 18
bar 22 KNOB 4: Swing up, 55% to 63%
turn K4 40 60
bar 24 Swing back
turn K4 -40 45
bar 25 HOME: back to the Dub page
tap HOME
expect view 0
# ------------------------------------------------------------------ PERFORM: the master actions ---
bar 26 5. PERFORM (SEL): the master actions
tap SEL
expect view 17
bar 27 KNOB 2: Dub up to +50 (the echo towards a runaway; the wider 1.2.0 Dub: +80 was 5 LU up, too far)
turn K2 25 100
bar 31 Dub back
turn K2 -25 60
bar 33 KNOB 3: Energy down to -80 (sparse)
turn K3 -40 60
bar 35 Energy up through 0 (it stops there) to +40 (busy: the wider Energy's +80 was 4 LU up)
turn K3 40 60
turn K3 20 60
bar 39 Energy back
turn K3 -20 60
bar 41 KNOB 4: Space up to +70 (the wider Space's +100 was a 3 LU wash)
turn K4 35 50
bar 44 Space back
turn K4 -35 45
bar 46 KNOB 1: the Filter, in PERFORM too (Open 70)
turn K1 35 50
bar 48 the Filter back to Off
turn K1 -35 50
# ------------------------------------------------------------------ white 6 held: the mix ---
bar 49 6. WHITE 6 HELD: the mix
key w5 down
expect view 7
bar 50 KNOB 3: the bass down
turn K3 -40 45
bar 52 the bass back
turn K3 40 45
expect par2 60
bar 53 white 4: the kick muted (white 6 still held)
tapkey w3
bar 54 white 4: the kick back (the Drums level as it was)
tapkey w3
expect par3 65
bar 55 let go of white 6
key w5 up
expect view 17
# ------------------------------------------------------------------ the finale: a transition by hand ---
bar 56 7. A TRANSITION BY HAND: Energy up, the Filter down
turn K3 20 50
turn K1 -45 60
bar 59 PRESETS: Haze, under water
turn PRESET 2 5
expect piece 7
bar 61 the Filter opens up on the downbeat
turn K1 45 45
bar 63 the master actions kept: Energy still up on Haze
bar 65 Energy back; SEL off
turn K3 -20 50
tap SEL
expect view 0
bar 67 END CARD (the music fades over the last bars)
bar 72 END
filmstop
wavstop
